<!--
Quick Settings tile (32dp): the full monogram, including the travelling beam.

  Colours come from @color/tile_icon rather than white, because SystemUI paints this on a panel that
  follows the *system* theme: a white mark on the light QS panel is no mark at all. (The status-bar
  icon keeps #FFFFFF on purpose - there the system uses the artwork as an alpha mask and tints it.)
-->
